    "Source PCache1 and private PGroup share one zeroed allocation; production Pager owns one heap Cache whose embedded private Group shares that allocation, followed by the fallible initial PageTable allocation.",
    "Source nMin is 10 per purgeable cache and unsigned mxPinned arithmetic is preserved with wrapping arithmetic.",
    "Source unified mode has no bulk-local pages; native cross-cache transfer therefore retains static/overflow allocation ownership safely."
